---
description: Playbook when the PR review automation or vacation maintenance runs
globs:
  - renovate.json
  - .cursor/automations/renovate-pr-review.md
---

When asked to review PRs or run vacation maintenance, read `.cursor/automations/renovate-pr-review.md` and follow it.

Review **all** open PRs, not only Renovate. Merge only when relevant checks are green (Sonar required). Otherwise leave the PR open and comment why.

Do not push to `main`. Do not merge majors, forks, or PRs with a failing/pending check.
